# This repository tracks only the umbrella files; every folder beside them is its own
# repository (or unrelated) and stays out. pyproject.toml, uv.lock and
# haywire.code-workspace stay out too: bin/umbrella-sync writes them for each machine
# from the repositories cloned there.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.python-version
!/README.md
!/bin/
# The session hooks: .claude/settings.json runs core's hooks (haywire-repo/dev/hooks).
# Only that file is tracked; settings.local.json and the rest stay each machine's own.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
